      "type": "text",
      "text": "100 mg PO BID, at least half an hour before or two hours after breakfast and dinner. 50 mg BID with strong or moderate CYP3A4 inhibitors (eg, ketoconazole, erythromycin, diltiazem) or CYP2C19 inhibitors (eg, fluconazole, omeprazole)."
